{"4874440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultrablight", "steam_appid": 4874440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4874740, 4874750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/c0b6ba9f3cc786b7322bbe4972f4bd46.avif?t=1787127485\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT IN THE HEART OF HELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTRABLIGHT is a fast-paced 3D survivors-like roguelite where cursed heroes battle through the circles of Hell, slaughter endless demonic hordes, and forge insanely powerful Backpack Builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fluid movement, defeat mighty Lords of Corruption, and become an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/05a488c69809959c30a7051e099af453.poster.avif?t=1787127485\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/05a488c69809959c30a7051e099af453.webm?t=1787127485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/05a488c69809959c30a7051e099af453.mp4?t=1787127485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/c0b6ba9f3cc786b7322bbe4972f4bd46.avif?t=1787127485\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CREATE INSANE BACKPACK BUILDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item changes the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons, spells, arrows, relics, companions, and hundreds of other items to create devastating synergies and transform an ordinary hero into an unstoppable killing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run creates a completely new build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/ddba7af14e71c6dc28a044daf6ea214e.poster.avif?t=1787127485\" width=722 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/ddba7af14e71c6dc28a044daf6ea214e.webm?t=1787127485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/ddba7af14e71c6dc28a044daf6ea214e.mp4?t=1787127485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4874440/extras/c0b6ba9f3cc786b7322bbe4972f4bd46.avif?t=1787127485\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EVERY RUN IS A NEW CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the circles of Hell, uncover hidden secrets, risk everything for powerful rewards, activate Blight Altars, defeat fearsome bosses, and push your run beyond the final battle in Endless Mode while climbing the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes a different run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap